## Derived work

The JSON-RPC transport in `crates/hermes-rpc` and the HTTP/WebSocket endpoint
contract in `crates/hermes-api` are ports of the Hermes gateway client that
ships with hermes-agent. The wire protocol, method names, event names and
close codes are taken from that source so this client interoperates with an
unmodified Hermes backend.

