## Dependencies

* `gpui` / `gpui_platform` (GPUI Community Edition) — MIT OR Apache-2.0,
  https://github.com/gpui-ce/gpui-ce. GPUI itself originates with Zed
  Industries, https://github.com/zed-industries/zed.
* `ksni` — MIT, StatusNotifierItem implementation used for the tray icon.
* All other Rust dependencies are linked at build time; run
  `cargo deny list` or `cargo license` for the resolved set.
